{c: Verse}

[Bm]Teri palkon ki [G]udhaari mein..bik [D]gaye

[Bm]Kho baithe dil,tere [G]dil mein tik [F#]gaye

[G]Chap gayi khabar yeh [D]akhbaar mein

[G]Chap gayi [Bm]khabar yeh [A]akhbaar mein

{c: Chorus}

[Em]Pad [A]gaye [Em]ji..

[Em]pad [A]gaye [Em]ji

[Bm]Hum padh [A]gaye [D]tere [A]pyaar [Bm]mein..[A]..[G]

[D]Tere [A]pyaar [Bm]mein..[A]..[G]

[D]tere [A]pyaar [Bm]mein..[A]..[G]

{c: Bridge}

[Bm]Haya sharam se chodhi humne aisi [A]yaari

Ki [Bm]jalti hai jo dekhti hai [G]class [A]saari [2 times]

[A]Deewaron [G]par bhi likh [F#m]diya tera [Bm]naam

[A]Hum toh ji [Em]takh rahe [A]khule [F#]aam

[G]Keh rahe bhare [D]bazaar mein

[G]Keh rahe [A]bhare [Em]bazaar mey

rest is same.
